    "chapter": 1,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "哪儿漂亮？\n\n丽丽：你看这个包漂亮吗？\n小何：漂亮！太漂亮了！\n丽丽：是吗？哪儿漂亮？\n小何：都漂亮。就这个红色的包了，买！\n丽丽：何京！我看的是黄色的包！",
    "traditional": "哪兒漂亮？\n\n麗麗：你看這個包漂亮嗎？\n小何：漂亮！太漂亮了！\n麗麗：是嗎？哪兒漂亮？\n小何：都漂亮。就這個紅色的包了，買！\n麗麗：何京！我看的是黃色的包！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What’s Pretty About It?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你看这个包漂亮吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你看這個包漂亮嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ kàn zhè ge bāo piào liang ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Does this bag look pretty to you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：漂亮！太漂亮了！",
      "traditional": "小何：漂亮！太漂亮了！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé piào liang tài piào liang le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Pretty! Very beautiful!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：是吗？哪儿漂亮？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：是嗎？哪兒漂亮？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì shì ma nǎ'r piào liang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Really? What’s pretty about it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：都漂亮。就这个红色的包了，买！",
      "traditional": "小何：都漂亮。就這個紅色的包了，買！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé dōu piào liang jiù zhè ge hóng sè de bāo le mǎi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: It’s all pretty. This red bag, buy it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：何京！我看的是黄色的包！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：何京！我看的是黃色的包！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hé jīng wǒ kàn de shì huáng sè de bāo",
